# Public API endpoints confirmed
GET /rest/1.0/hosts → 200 (full hoster list)
GET /rest/1.0/hosts/domains → 200 (domain list)
GET /rest/1.0/hosts/regex → 200 (URL regex patterns)
GET /rest/1.0/hosts/regexFolder → 200 (folder regex patterns)

# OAuth2 endpoints exist (return 400 with "parameter_missing" / "wrong_parameter")
POST /oauth/v2/auth → 400 (requires params)
POST /oauth/v2/device/code → 400 (requires params)

